    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-19813",
      "publishedDate": "2026-08-14T08:00:11.323Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-08-14T08:00:11.323Z",
      "description": "A security vulnerability has been detected in TOTOLINK A800R 4.1.2cu.5137_B20200730. This impacts the function setMacFilterRules of the file /cgi-bin/cstecgi.cgi of the component firewall.so. Such manipulation of the argument Comment leads to stack-based buffer overflow. The attack may be performed from remote. The exploit has been disclosed publicly and may be used.",
      "severity": 8.8,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：TOTOLINK A800R\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
